srow(173, 1, 'MATERIAL', f'"FOR AN ABOMINATION TO THE LORD IS EVERYONE WHO DOES THESE" (18:12) — MIGHT HE NOT BE LIABLE UNTIL HE TRANSGRESSES ALL? "EVERYONE WHO DOES THESE" — EVEN ONE OF THEM. The head row of piska 173 ({SP_(173, 1, "עד", "שיעבור", "על", "כלם")} "until he transgresses all of them"; {SP_(173, 1, "אפלו", "על", "אחת", "מהם")} "even for one of them"): THE LIST DISJUNCTIVE — each of the nine its own liability ("an abomination of the LORD" the Torah\'s eight, asserted): the compile\'s nine effects independent. Fresh.')
