srow(176, 3, 'MATERIAL', f'"AND I WILL PUT MY WORDS IN HIS MOUTH" (18:18) — MY WORDS I PUT IN HIS MOUTH, BUT I DO NOT SPEAK WITH HIM FACE TO FACE. ANOTHER WORD: FROM HERE ON, KNOW HOW THE HOLY SPIRIT IS PUT IN THE PROPHETS\' MOUTH. ({SP_(176, 3, "אבל", "איני", "מדבר", "עמו", "פנים", "בפנים")} "but I do not speak with him face to face"; {SP_(176, 3, "היאך", "רוח", "הקדש", "נתנת", "בפי", "הנביאים")} "how the Holy Spirit is put in the prophets\' mouth"): "LIKE YOU" WITH ONE DIFFERENCE — the words in the mouth, not face to face (34:10\'s "whom the LORD knew face to face", asserted; "My words in his mouth" one seat, "in your mouth" Jeremiah 1:9\'s); ONKELOS "the words of My PROPHECY" (the book\'s one "prophecy", asserted): the compile\'s prophet a channel, Moses the exception — the mode a parameter. Fresh.')
